<link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= assetPath('/css/service-range.css?v=74') %>">
<% const tick = '<svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>'; %>
<div class="services services-refresh">
  <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="services-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom:0">
        <div>
          
          <h1 class="display-xl" id="services-title">Support for every stage <span class="serif">of your dealership.</span></h1>
        </div>
        <p class="lede" style="margin:0">From your first application to annual returns, ongoing compliance and motor-finance broker support. Find the next step that fits your dealership.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec sec--flush-top" aria-label="Choose a service">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="svc-grid svc-grid--3">
        <article class="svc" data-range-motion>
          <div class="svc__art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 360 230" aria-hidden="true"><defs><filter id="service-shadow"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="12" stdDeviation="10" flood-color="#14243a" flood-opacity=".12"/></filter></defs><g class="sheet sheet-back"><rect x="116" y="35" width="145" height="170" rx="12" fill="#a8d5f5" stroke="#8bbce6"/></g><g class="sheet sheet-mid"><rect x="95" y="25" width="145" height="170" rx="12" fill="#d6eaff" stroke="#a4c6eb"/></g><g class="sheet sheet-front" filter="url(#service-shadow)"><rect x="74" y="20" width="145" height="170" rx="12" fill="white" stroke="#bdd1e7"/><rect x="91" y="39" width="30" height="30" rx="8" fill="#2563eb"/><path d="M100 48h12m-12 6h9m-9 6h12" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="133" y="50" fill="#14243a" font-size="10" font-weight="700">APPLICATION</text><text x="133" y="64" fill="#7591b0" font-size="8">Getting organised</text><path d="M92 87h104" stroke="#dfebf5"/><g fill="#edf4fb"><rect x="92" y="102" width="13" height="13" rx="4"/><rect x="92" y="128" width="13" height="13" rx="4"/><rect x="92" y="154" width="13" height="13" rx="4"/></g><g stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path class="tick t1" pathLength="1" d="m95 108 3 3 5-6"/><path class="tick t2" pathLength="1" d="m95 134 3 3 5-6"/><path class="tick t3" pathLength="1" d="m95 160 3 3 5-6"/></g><g stroke="#b5c8dc" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M117 108h67"/><path d="M117 134h54"/><path d="M117 160h62"/></g></g><g class="floating-note" filter="url(#service-shadow)"><rect x="195" y="139" width="113" height="49" rx="12" fill="#14243a"/><circle cx="214" cy="163" r="10" fill="#315374"/><path d="m210 163 3 3 5-6" stroke="#a8d5f5" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/><text x="232" y="160" font-size="9" fill="#fff" font-weight="700">STEP BY STEP</text><text x="232" y="174" font-size="8" fill="#a8c7e6">With you throughout</text></g><g class="paper-spark" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"><path d="M270 60v14m-7-7h14M50 142v10m-5-5h10"/></g></svg></div>
          <div class="svc__body">
            <h2 class="display-m" style="font-size:clamp(24px,2.2vw,30px)">FCA Authorisation Assistance</h2>
            <p>Practical help with FCA applications for car, motorcycle, van and commercial vehicle dealers, from your business plan and bespoke documents to FCA Connect and the questions that follow.</p>
            <ul><li>Bespoke business plan and compliance documents</li><li>FCA Connect support and interview preparation</li><li>Help responding to FCA information requests</li></ul>
            <% if (campaign.showPrice) { %><div class="svc__price"><% if (campaign.active) { %><span class="muted">Christmas offer · closes <%= campaign.closingLabel %></span><br><% } %><strong>£<%= offer.startPayment %></strong> to get started, then <strong>£<%= offer.monthlyPayment %></strong>/month<br><span class="muted"><%= offer.qualifier %></span></div><% } else { %><div class="svc__price"><strong>Speak to us about pricing</strong><br><span class="muted">FCA application fee payable separately.</span></div><% } %>
            <div class="svc__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm btn--sheen" href="/contact#book-meeting">Book a 15-minute call</a><a class="text-link" href="/fca-authorisation-motor-dealers">Service details</a></div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="svc" data-range-motion>
          <div class="svc__art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 360 230" aria-hidden="true"><g class="report-board" filter="url(#service-shadow)"><rect x="57" y="35" width="246" height="158" rx="15" fill="white" stroke="#b2dcd3"/><path d="M58 68h244" stroke="#d3ebe4"/><circle cx="74" cy="52" r="3" fill="#a9d2c8"/><circle cx="84" cy="52" r="3" fill="#a9d2c8"/><circle cx="94" cy="52" r="3" fill="#a9d2c8"/><text x="117" y="56" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#14243a">CCR009</text><rect x="242" y="45" width="44" height="14" rx="7" fill="#d5f5ec"/><g stroke="#e1f0eb"><path d="M74 99h212M74 127h212M74 155h212M146 80v94M219 80v94"/></g><g class="report-row row-one" fill="#99c9c3"><rect x="76" y="83" width="49" height="5" rx="2"/><rect x="160" y="83" width="34" height="5" rx="2"/><rect x="236" y="83" width="38" height="5" rx="2"/></g><g class="report-row row-two" fill="#75b8ae"><rect x="76" y="111" width="37" height="5" rx="2"/><rect x="160" y="111" width="42" height="5" rx="2"/><rect x="236" y="111" width="30" height="5" rx="2"/></g><g class="report-row row-three" fill="#56a69a"><rect x="76" y="139" width="52" height="5" rx="2"/><rect x="160" y="139" width="31" height="5" rx="2"/><rect x="236" y="139" width="36" height="5" rx="2"/></g><rect class="scan-line" x="65" y="76" width="230" height="25" rx="5" fill="#0d9488" opacity=".1"/></g><g class="data-tile tile-one" filter="url(#service-shadow)"><rect x="25" y="122" width="76" height="73" rx="14" fill="#0d9488"/><g fill="#fff"><rect x="40" y="155" width="10" height="23" rx="3"/><rect x="57" y="142" width="10" height="36" rx="3"/><rect x="74" y="133" width="10" height="45" rx="3"/></g></g><g class="data-tile tile-two" filter="url(#service-shadow)"><rect x="240" y="18" width="78" height="58" rx="12" fill="#14243a"/><path d="m257 41 8 8 18-17" stroke="#99f6e4" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M257 60h42" stroke="#59b7ad" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></g></svg></div>
          <div class="svc__body">
            <h2 class="display-m" style="font-size:clamp(24px,2.2vw,30px)">CCR009 Return Assistance</h2>
            <p>Structured support with your annual consumer credit return, organising the information dealers need before the RegData window opens.</p>
            <ul><li>Finance introductions, commission and lender records</li><li>Monthly management information through the year</li><li>Your firm stays responsible for its submission</li></ul>
            <div class="svc__price"><strong>Priced separately</strong><br><span class="muted">Scope and pricing confirmed before engagement.</span></div>
            <div class="svc__actions"><a class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" href="/ccr009-return-assistance-motor-dealers">Explore CCR009 assistance</a></div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="svc" data-range-motion>
          <div class="svc__art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 360 230" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="180" cy="115" r="89" fill="none" stroke="#cdb8ed" stroke-dasharray="3 8"/><ellipse cx="180" cy="115" rx="135" ry="62" fill="none" stroke="#e0d1f1"/><g class="orbit-bead"><circle cx="180" cy="26" r="6" fill="#8050cf"/><circle cx="180" cy="26" r="12" fill="#8050cf" opacity=".1"/></g><g class="calendar" filter="url(#service-shadow)"><rect x="116" y="51" width="132" height="135" rx="16" fill="white" stroke="#d3bfeb"/><path d="M116 84h132" stroke="#e9def5"/><path d="M145 45v18M219 45v18" stroke="#14243a" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/><text x="150" y="75" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#14243a">ONGOING SUPPORT</text><g fill="#e8ddf5"><rect x="134" y="99" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="159" y="99" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="184" y="99" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="209" y="99" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="134" y="122" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="159" y="122" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="184" y="122" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="209" y="122" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="134" y="145" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="159" y="145" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="184" y="145" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/><rect x="209" y="145" width="15" height="14" rx="4"/></g><rect class="calendar-day" x="184" y="122" width="15" height="14" rx="4" fill="#8050cf"/><path d="m188 128 3 3 5-6" stroke="white" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><g class="chat-one" filter="url(#service-shadow)"><path d="M38 71q0-12 12-12h60q12 0 12 12v28q0 12-12 12H65l-15 12v-12q-12 0-12-12Z" fill="#14243a"/><g fill="#d6bafa"><circle class="chat-dot dot1" cx="60" cy="85" r="4"/><circle class="chat-dot dot2" cx="80" cy="85" r="4"/><circle class="chat-dot dot3" cx="100" cy="85" r="4"/></g></g><g class="chat-two" filter="url(#service-shadow)"><path d="M235 136q0-12 12-12h61q12 0 12 12v28q0 12-12 12h-8v12l-16-12h-37q-12 0-12-12Z" fill="#8050cf"/><path d="M251 144h52m-52 12h33" stroke="#f2eaff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g></svg></div>
          <div class="svc__body">
            <h2 class="display-m" style="font-size:clamp(24px,2.2vw,30px)">Ongoing Compliance Support</h2>
            <p>Direct access to experienced people, documentation assistance and periodic reviews that keep compliance organised throughout the year.</p>
            <ul><li>Plain-English support when questions arise</li><li>Documentation, record keeping and reporting preparation</li><li>Fixed monthly support on a fair-use basis</li></ul>
            <div class="svc__price"><strong>Fixed monthly fee</strong><br><span class="muted">Speak to us about pricing. Confirmed before engagement.</span></div>
            <div class="svc__actions"><a class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" href="/motor-dealer-compliance">Explore ongoing support</a></div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="svc svc-finance" data-range-motion><div class="svc__art" aria-hidden="true"><%- include('partials/finance_service_art') %></div><div class="svc__body"><h2 class="display-m" style="font-size:clamp(24px,2.2vw,30px)">Motor Finance for Dealerships</h2><p>Help your customers explore finance with broker support backed by 30+ years of motor-finance experience.</p><ul><li>A conversation about your dealership’s needs</li><li>Understand onboarding and the broker relationship</li><li>Clear next steps for customer-finance enquiries</li></ul><div class="svc__price"><strong>Discuss the arrangement</strong><br><span class="muted">Separate from compliance subscriptions. Finance is subject to lender assessment and terms; approval is not guaranteed.</span></div><div class="svc__actions"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="/contact?topic=finance#book-meeting">Discuss motor finance</a><a class="text-link" href="/motor-finance-for-dealerships">Explore finance support</a></div></div></article>
      </div>
      <p class="fine center" style="margin-top:18px">Services have separate scopes and terms. The authorisation offer applies only to authorisation assistance; it is not the price of CCR009, standalone ongoing support or motor-finance arrangements.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/meeting_invite', { meetingContext: 'general' }) %>

  <section class="sec sec--flush-top" aria-labelledby="detail-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          
          <h2 class="display-l" id="detail-title">What our support <span class="serif">can cover.</span></h2>
          <p class="lede">You’ll have direct access to a real person, not a call centre or ticket system. Our work draws on decades of experience gained across vehicle finance and the motor trade.</p>
          <figure style="margin:30px 0 0"><img src="/images/support.jpg" alt="009 Compliance support" width="1118" height="633" loading="lazy" style="border-radius:24px;display:block;width:100%;height:auto"></figure>
        </div>
        <div class="more" style="margin-top:0">
          <details open>
            <summary>Ongoing compliance support</summary>
            <div class="more__body"><p>We provide practical, plain-English compliance support to help you understand FCA requirements and guidance in the context of how motor dealerships operate in practice. Whether the query relates to processes, documentation or an FCA request, we are available to explain expectations clearly and calmly, helping compliance feel structured and manageable rather than overwhelming.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>FCA authorisation assistance</summary>
            <div class="more__body"><p>We assist firms through the FCA authorisation process from start to finish. This includes support with completing applications, responding to FCA information requests and preparing for follow-up discussions where required.</p><p>We also assist with the preparation of compliance policies and supporting documents that reflect how your business operates in practice. <a href="/fca-authorisation-motor-dealers">Read more about FCA authorisation for motor dealers</a>.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Compliance documentation support</summary>
            <div class="more__body"><p>We assist with the preparation of compliance documentation appropriate to your business activities and regulatory permissions, using straightforward language so documents are practical for day-to-day use. This may include documentation covering vulnerable customers, compliance monitoring, customer journey mapping, regulatory status disclosure, suitability and fair treatment, complaints handling and financial crime awareness.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>CCR007 and CCR009 returns assistance</summary>
            <div class="more__body"><p>We assist firms with the preparation of annual FCA regulatory returns, including CCR007 and CCR009. This includes support in understanding the information requested, organising and structuring data and assisting with the preparation of figures and summaries for submission. <a href="/ccr009-return-assistance-motor-dealers">Read more about CCR009 return assistance</a>.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Ongoing data collection and monitoring</summary>
            <div class="more__body"><p>We support firms in collecting and organising key regulatory information throughout the year rather than leaving everything until the end of a reporting period. Spreading data capture over time improves accuracy, reduces disruption to day-to-day trading and makes annual reporting more predictable and controlled.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Annual website regulatory review</summary>
            <div class="more__body"><p>A high-level annual review of website content relating to business, finance and regulatory information, helping keep public-facing information clear, current and consistent.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Annual FCA and Companies House alignment check</summary>
            <div class="more__body"><p>A high-level annual comparison of key information held with the FCA and Companies House against how the business operates in practice, helping highlight obvious changes or inconsistencies.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Quarterly complaints and customer feedback review</summary>
            <div class="more__body"><p>Organisation and periodic review of complaints and customer feedback, including public review sources, to help identify recurring themes or emerging issues.</p></div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Quarterly vulnerable-customer awareness review</summary>
            <div class="more__body"><p>A periodic review of customer feedback and information to help highlight potential indicators of misunderstanding, distress or reduced capability, keeping customer needs visible over time.</p></div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/closer') %>

  <section class="sec sec--tight sec--flush-top">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <p class="note"><strong>Important note.</strong> Our role is to provide structured compliance support and clear explanations. Responsibility for regulatory decisions, interpretations and submissions remains with the authorised firm.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

